  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You stopped saying goodnight",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That was the first sign that you were letting go",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Now you don't see me the same way",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You're looking at me like I'm only getting old",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "And I shoulda known",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That you were only scared to be alone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I couldn't say much, I was distracted",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You seemed so anxious like you had something to hide",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Tell me, \"It's nothing\", I don't believe you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I know that look you get when you're about to lie",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "I feel so stupid, mm-mm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "'Cause I still say goodnight",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I always tried to impress you",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Got so dressed up and you never seemed to care",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Your ridiculous expectations, lack of validations",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Was never fucking fair",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
